Package: niac
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: NIAC - Network Infrastructure Agent Cluster
 NIAC is a network device simulator supporting:
  - SNMP agent simulation
  - Device template management
  - Walk file capture and replay
  - Multi-device orchestration
  - WebUI for configuration
 .
 This package provides the niac binary, systemd service,
 and default configuration files.
